  "details": "Basically meaning you can have a set parameter that will rescale any avatar you swap to automatically (of course this should be toggleable between on/off).\n\nFor example, let's say you're comfortable being at 1.71M, you would specify that measurement (this being 1.71) and when you swap to an avatar that's shorter/taller it'll automatically set you to your desired scaling (If enabled).\n\nOf course this should go along with world limits and other restrictions.\n\nOverall, I thought that this may seem helpful for some people :)",
